# Channels and a channel consumer: two named sub-pipelines branch from the
# same upstream value, and Zip pairs them element-wise.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers

Channel "evens":
    Cursed Technique: Filter
        Using: (x) -> x % 2 = 0

Channel "odds":
    Cursed Technique: Filter
        Using: (x) -> x % 2 = 1

Maximum Technique: Zip
    From: evens, odds
Maximum Technique: Sum By
    Using: (p) -> prow(p) * pcol(p)
Reveal: stdout
